      <p class="msc-section-kicker">Bitcoin Ecosystem</p>
      <h1>How Bitcoin Industry Leaders Shape the Ecosystem</h1>
      <p class="msc-learn-page__deck">Bitcoin has no official industry leader, CEO, governing board, or spokesperson. People and organizations can still exert substantial influence through capital, products, custody, mining infrastructure, open-source funding, standards, media, policy, and distribution. Evaluating that influence requires identifying its source, incentives, dependencies, accountability, exit options, and limits.</p>
      <ul class="msc-learn-page-meta"><li>People</li><li>Shallow</li><li>Ecosystem Overview</li><li>23 to 27 minutes</li><li>Reviewed 2026-07-26</li></ul>
